# Unity generated folders
**/.utmp/
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Bb]uild/
**/[Bb]uilds/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
*.log

# MemoryCaptures / Recordings can get excessive in size
**/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
**/[Rr]ecordings/

# Autogenerated JetBrains Rider plugin / settings
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
*.DotSettings.user

# Visual Studio cache directory
**/.vs/

# Gradle cache directory
**/.gradle/

# Autogenerated VS/MD/Consulo solution and project files
**/ExportedObj/
**/.consulo/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# Unity generated meta files
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# Unity generated file on crash reports
sysinfo.txt

# Mono auto generated files
mono_crash.*

# Builds
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta
*.app

# Crashlytics generated file
crashlytics-build.properties

# TestRunner generated files
**/InitTestScene*.unity*

# Addressables default ignores
**/ServerData
**/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/aa*
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/link.xml*
**/[Aa]ssets/Addressables_Temp*
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*

# Visual Scripting auto-generated files
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db.meta
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property Providers.meta

# Auto-generated scenes/caches
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ii]nit[Tt]est[Ss]cene*.unity*
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]ceneDependencyCache*

# --- Python / ML-Agents (training side) ---
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/results/*
**/summaries/
!**/results/README.md

# --- Claude Code ---
# .claude/ 와 CLAUDE.md는 이 저장소의 워크플로 문서라 커밋한다.
# 로컬 전용 설정만 제외.
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/.mcp.json
**/.claude.json
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/EvaluationResults/

# ML-Agents timer dump
**/[Aa]ssets/ML-Agents/
**/[Aa]ssets/ML-Agents.meta

# Editor screenshots captured during verification
**/[Aa]ssets/Screenshots/
**/[Aa]ssets/Screenshots.meta

# 저장소 루트를 Unity 프로젝트로 잘못 열면 여기에 빈 프로젝트 껍데기가 생긴다.
# (루트의 assets/ 를 Windows가 대소문자 구분 없이 Assets/ 로 인식해서 벌어진다)
# 진짜 프로젝트 설정은 UnityProject/ 아래에 있고 그쪽은 계속 추적한다.
/Packages/
/ProjectSettings/
